<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-states"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20States.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United States</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Apollo 11 lands the first astronauts on the Moon</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-honduras"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Honduras.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Honduras</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Honduras and El Salvador fight the Football War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-el-salvador"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20El%20Salvador.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of El Salvador</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">El Salvador and Honduras fight the Football War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/south-yemen"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/South%20Yemen.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>South Yemen</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Corrective Move removes President Qahtan al-Shaabi</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/malaysia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Malaysia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Malaysia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Racial riots of 13 May lead to emergency rule and the New Economic Policy</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/barotseland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Barotseland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Barotseland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Zambia abrogates the agreement and renames the area Western Province</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/muisca-confederation"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Muisca%20Confederation.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Muisca Confederation</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A gold votive raft is found in a cave at Pasca</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/magna-carta"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Magna%20Carta.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Magna Carta</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Statute Law (Repeals) Act left only clauses 1, 9 and 29 of the 1297 statute in force</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/francoist-spain"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Francoist%20Spain.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Francoist Spain</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Franco designates Juan Carlos of Bourbon as his heir, and Spain closes its border with Gibraltar</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-cambodia-1953-1970"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Cambodia%20(1953-1970).png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Cambodia (1953-1970)</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The United States begins the Menu airstrikes on communist sanctuaries in Cambodia, and full diplomatic relations are restored</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/ho-chi-minh"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Ho%20Chi%20Minh.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Ho Chi Minh</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Dies of heart failure at his home in Hanoi, with the outcome of the Vietnam War still in question</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/chan-chan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Chan%20Chan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Chan Chan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Michael Moseley and Carol J. Mackey begin excavations</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/prague-spring"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Prague%20Spring.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Prague Spring</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Jan Palach sets himself on fire in 